 Engineering | Middleware |         2 |       2 | 300         | 0               | 300
 Finance     | Database   |         2 |       2 | 330         | 90              | 420
 Finance     | Middleware |         1 |       1 | 420         | 0               | 420
 Finance     | Service    |         1 |       1 | 240         | 0               | 240
 Marketing   | Service    |         3 |       3 | 140         | 240             | 380
 Marketing   | Database   |         1 |       1 | 310         | 0               | 310
(7 rows)

